rgin-top: 17px;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      border: 1px solid #3d3d3d;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1;\n    }\n\n    col.label-col {\n      width: 83px;\n    }\n\n    th,\n    td {\n      height: 30px;\n      padding: 0 4px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #555;\n      text-align: center;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    th {\n      color: #fff;\n      background: #737373;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n\n    th:first-child,\n    td:first-child {\n      padding-left: 12px;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    td {\n      color: #1f1f1f;\n      background: #eee;\n      font-weight: 600;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 539px) {\n      .page {\n        transform-origin: top center;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <article class=\"card\">\n      <header class=\"header\">\n        <h1>家庭净水器选购指南</h1>\n        <div class=\"account\">@吃货万万岁</div>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"content\">\n        <section class=\"section\">\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">\n            <span class=\"check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span>1.选RO反渗透净水器，别选超滤净水器</span>\n          </h2>\n          <p>超滤膜过滤精度只有0.01微米，而RO膜是0.0001微米。差距是<br>100倍！所以一定要选RO反渗透！</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section\">\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">\n            <span class=\"check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span>2.通量选大于800G的</span>\n          </h2>\n          <p>通量决定了出水速度，出水速度大后，净水器就不光可以饮水，<br>还可以洗碗、洗水果、煲汤等</p>\n\n          <table>\n            <colgroup>\n              <col class=\"label-col\">\n              <col>\n              <col>\n              <col>\n              <col>\n              <col>\n            </colgroup>\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>通量</th>\n                <th>400G</th>\n                <th>600G</th>\n                <th>800G</th>\n                <th>1000G</th>\n                <th>1200G</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>出水速度</td>\n                <td>1L/min</td>\n                <td>1.5L/min</td>\n                <td>2L/min</td>\n                <td>2.5L/min</td>\n                <td>3L/min</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section section-three\">\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">\n            <span class=\"check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span>3.最好选0添加0阻垢剂0陈水的</span>\n          </h2>\n          <p>阻垢剂并不能增强滤芯的过滤性能，也不能改善纯水的水质。同<br>时，阻垢剂中的含磷物质还会造成水体营养化，所以尽量选择0<br>阻垢剂的净水器。0陈水的意思，就是不会储水。这样我们就不<br>会喝到隔夜水了～每天清晨的第一杯水不需要倒掉。</p>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"section section-four\">\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">\n            <span class=\"check\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n            <span>4.空间小选无桶，预算低选有桶</span>\n          </h2>\n          <p>净水器有桶无桶其实都可以！有桶也不会造成细菌污染（都是无<br>桶商家踩出来的）。所以，你根据实际场景选！空间小选无桶，<br>预算低选有桶。</p>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
